  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0a307fc-da28-41b0-adc7-6c1c39291e2a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"256\"></strong></p><h1>📜简介</h1><p><span style=\"color:#c2235e\"><strong>灾变：法术书</strong></span> 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a> 的附属模组。</p><p>目前该模组总共添加了 <strong>65</strong> 种新法术，未来还将继续开发更多。此外，本模组还新增了两个法术学派：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em>深渊</em></span></span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span>和<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#34495e;text-decoration:underline\">科技巫术</span></em></span></span>。深渊学派包含了所有与 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">利维坦</span> 相关的法术，而科技巫术则灵感源自 <span style=\"color:#34495e\">先驱者</span>。</p><p><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意：本模组仍在开发中，法术将持续添加！</em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意 2：“玩家，请安装 Azurelib，”开发者恳求道。然后开发者倒地身亡。</em></span></strong></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong><em>注意 3：1.20.1 版本已不再支持。请勿移植本模组或在任何网站重新上传！</em></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">如果您想了解计划中的法术，请前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 页面</a>查看！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aeffb23a-0e37-44ba-9321-8e639672834e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eefc4371-f197-4e88-a5ca-9d369c18f408.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">🔗链接</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a4fcb4e-d28f-4544-b647-f1470c52b2ba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d1e389d-cf70-413b-a4f7-5d3cd5fbc578.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/0starocean0/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcataclysm-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4f1bf25d-b950-4f4b-b435-0e7d6b8e664d.png\" alt=